6. Models and other Outputs

"Outputs" means the models, textures, images, animations, videos, scene data,
and user project data You produce through authorized use of the Kit. Merely
using the Kit or its project format does not make an Output Covered Materials.

The Licensor claims no ownership, royalty, Kit attribution requirement, or
redistribution restriction over Your Outputs solely because You used the Kit.
You may use, edit, sell, license, and distribute authorized Outputs, including
on BOOTH or ELYTH, without a separate Output permission from the Licensor.
Those rights are not lost when You stop using the Kit, cross the financial
threshold, or end a commercial agreement. Continued use of the Kit itself must
still comply with Sections 2 and 3.

Calling something an Output does not exempt a copy of Kit code, a Skill, or
other substantial Covered Materials embedded in it from this License. Rights
in source artwork, third-party assets, sample characters, AI-generated content,
and external services remain subject to their own terms. No ownership or
commercial-use clearance for such material is guaranteed by this License.

